A fork of the MedusaKenrelProject, based on the AnyKenrel3 package

Author of this fork/repository/kernel is not responsible for any damage caused by this modifications.

Why did i make it;
- Overclock CPU (Actually no, i lost access to my j4+ and couldnt figure out how to properly implement the dtb)
- Compile it
- Get some experience
- Let everyone else download it too comfortably (All links i found were dead, instead of this one)

How to install;
- Grab the latest "medusa-unmodded.zip" from releases
- Flash
- Enjoy

Requirements;
- Android 10
- TWRP
- Snapdragon 425
- J4+
- U6/S6 Bootloader
Recommendations;
- Good binning
- 3/32GB version

!IMPORTANT!
Magisk isn't perfectly compatable with the MedusaKenrel.
From my experience;
First, flash magisk v23 via .zip
Second, flash medusa kenrel via .zip

Now you can safely update both magisk (via app) and medusakenrel (via zip)

Otherwise it wont work!

"If you can't find something, make it yourself" - A wise person
